	(gr_text "Note!\nThis board only supports positive levels. I.e. the 12597A-01 / 12597-6002 board which\nuses ground and -12V as signal levels is NOT supported.\n\nSupported boards are:\n12566A, 12566B and 12566C - Please check the jumpers for correct operation\n12597A, 12597A-02 and 12597A-03 - Also check jumpers for correct operation"
